# FPL Analyst AI — environment variables
#
# All variables here are read server-side only (Vite dev middleware in
# server/, or the /api serverless functions in production). None of them
# are prefixed with VITE_, so none are ever bundled into the browser build.
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development.

# --- AI provider (optional) ---------------------------------------------
# If neither key is set, the app automatically uses the built-in
# deterministic "mock" analyst provider — the AI explanation feature still
# works out of the box, it just won't be model-generated prose.
# If both are set, Anthropic is used.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional overrides:
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com
# AI_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Optional overrides:
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# --- FPL data --------------------------------------------------------------
# No key required — /api/fpl/* proxies the public, unauthenticated official
# Fantasy Premier League API server-side (to avoid the browser CORS block).
# If that API is unreachable, the app automatically falls back to a
# clearly-labelled demo dataset.
